<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτηριακός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for the trachea</i> or
			<i>bronchi,</i> esp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κή</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίδοτος</span>), ἡ, <i>medicament for their treatment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				20.207
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.136
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις</span> Androm.ib.<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					8.54
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κὸν ἴσχαιμον</span> styptic for
				<i>arterial</i> haemorrhage, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πάθος, τὰ ἀ.,</span>
			affections <i>of these organs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				3.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> a medicine, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				8.54
			</span></i> sq.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀ. κοιλία τῆς καρδίας</span>”
				<i>left ventricle,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Placit.
					4.5.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φωνή,</span> of the human
			voice, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν ὀργάνων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				2
			</span></i>.</div>
